Fix false positives for ``no-method-argument``, ``no-self-argument``,
``arguments-differ``, ``inherit-non-class`` and ``too-many-ancestors`` when a class
statement has a base whose type is not a subclass of ``type``, like
``zope.interface`` interfaces. Such a class statement does not create a class, so
the functions defined in its body are not methods.

Closes #11651
